+## Phase 2: User Story 1 - Migrate Greeting REST endpoint (Priority: P1) 🎯 MVP
+
+**Goal**: Migrate `GET /greeting` from Spring Boot `@RestController` to Quarkus JAX-RS `@Path` resource at `/api/greeting`
+
+**Independent Test**: `mvn -q clean test` passes; `@QuarkusTest` asserts `GET /api/greeting` returns HTTP 200 with correct JSON
+
+### Implementation for User Story 1
+
+- [ ] T010 [P] [US1] Create `src/main/java/com/demo/Greeting.java` — Java record `Greeting(long id, String content)` (migrated from `com.example.restservice.Greeting`)
+- [ ] T011 [P] [US1] Create `src/main/java/com/demo/Application.java` — Quarkus bootstrap class with `public static void main` (replaces `@SpringBootApplication RestServiceApplication`)
