+- [ ] T013 [US1] Create `src/test/java/com/demo/GreetingResourceTest.java` — `@QuarkusTest` with `@Test` asserting `GET /api/greeting` returns 200 with JSON `{ "id": long, "content": "Hello, World!" }` and `GET /api/greeting?name=Quarkus` returns `"Hello, Quarkus!"` (migrated from `GreetingControllerTests.java`)
+
